        "market_blurb": "Flowery Branch, Georgia sits along Lake Lanier in Hall County and has grown from a small rail town into a bedroom community blending light manufacturing, distribution, and retail with recreation-driven tourism. Its economy benefits from proximity to Gainesville's poultry and agribusiness sector as well as the Atlanta Falcons' training complex, which anchors local commerce and development. Steady residential growth has fueled demand for retail, healthcare, and home services throughout the area.",
